   skillmirror  ·  javedab.com

  Sync agent skills across all your projects from a single vault.

  │ Sync     Refresh the skills each project already has; never adds one
    List     Every installed skill; filter, then sync or delete in place
    Delete   Nothing pre-selected; you pick, then confirm
    Push     Install the mandatory skills into every opted-in project
    Add      Install chosen vault skills into one project
    Init     Make a new project folder with your skills in it
    History  Undo a sync, push or delete from the backups
    Setup    Choose the vault, the scan root and the mandatory skills
  ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  Walks every project under your root and updates skills they already have
  installed, pulling the latest from your vault. The opt-in rule: if a project
  doesn't have a skill, it will inshallah never be added. Only what's already
  there gets refreshed.






